    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abiya ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gw'ikūmi n'īnaane go būtemi bo ng'wa Yeloboamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati, Abiya ūbiza ntemi wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtema myaka idatū alī mu Yelusalemu; ū nina ī lina lyakwe walī Maaka, nshīke bo ng'wa Abishalomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abishalomu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nzīla yīngī yakulyandīka lina lya ng'wa Abusalomu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshimīzīla ū mu būbi ū bose ūbo walī wawīta ū ise ūyo walī wantonga ū kūbiza ho; ī ng'holò yakwe yalī ītī na būtūngīlīja ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wakwe, gīt'ūmo yalī ng'holò ya ng'wa Daūdi ū ise nkūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo naheene kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Daūdi, ū SEEBA Mulungu wakwe ūng'winha talà ū mu Yelusalemu; ūmūūkīja ng'wana wa kwingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, nū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu ongeja kūgwinha nguzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Daūdi walī wīta yawiza ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, atalekanile na shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA shose shose ū mu shikū ja būlamu wakwe; ūlū ītī mu mhayo go ng'wa Ulia ū Ng'hītī dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū ja būlamu bo ng'wa Abiya ī jose, boolīho būlūgū a ha gatī ya ng'wa Lehoboamu nū Yeloboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Abiya, nī yīyo wīta ī yose yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Yuda. Boolīho būlūgū a ha gatī ya ng'wa Abiya nū Yeloboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Abiya wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīīkwa mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi. Ng'witūnja wakwe Asa wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Asa ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa makūmi abīlī go būtemi bo ng'wa Yeloboamu ntemi wa Isilaeli, Asa wandya kūbiza ntemi wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtema myaka makūmi anè alī mu Yelusalemu; ū mamayī ī lina lyakwe walī Maaka, nshīke o ng'wa Abishalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Asa wīta yawiza ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, gīt'ūmo walī wītīla ise Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bamalahya a bagosha, abo biyītaga kūbiza gītī bakīma, ūbapeeja ū mu sī, ūshīnja nī shiikolile īsho walī washibeeja ū ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū maamaaye ū Maaka ūng'wīngīja ī likūjo īlo lyang'winhaga lūgiili giili gīkī ntema nkīma ninaabo, nguno walī wabeeja ikīngī lyabūbi lya ng'wa Ashela. Ū Asa ūlībbutagūla ī likīngī lyenīlo ūūkalīponya kū longa lwa Kiduloni ūlīpemba na moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū īkī atagīngije a mapandī ga higūlya, ū Asa walī wīfunya gete ī ng'holò yakwe kūlī SEEBA ū mu būlamu wakwe pyī ū bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī zahabu nī feza nī shikolo ī shingī īsho ū wei nū ise balī bashifunya sheejiwa, ūshenha mu hekalua ya ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wanishi ha gatī ya Isilaeli na Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho būlūgū a ha gatī ya ng'wa Asa nū Baasha ū ntemi wa Isilaeli, ū mu shikū jabo jose aho balī batemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ikanza ilebe ū Baasha ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūja kwīdumīla ī Yuda; nzengo gwa Lama wandya kūgūzengeela ngītīli ya ndugu kūgūpīndīlīja, kūlwa kūbahangīja abo balī na ng'hūmbū ja kwīnga, nūūlū kūja kū sī ya ng'wa Asa ū ntemi wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Asa ūjisola pyī ī feza nī zahabu ījo jalī jasaagīīla ū ng'wibīkīlo lya sabo lya mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, jingī ūsola kūfuma mu numba y'ikūlū. Ūbinha batūmami bakwe ūbatūma kū ng'wa Beni-hadadi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Tabulioni, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hezioni ntemi wa Alamu, ūyo wikalaga mu nzengo gwa Damasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Twitūūlīlage būlagane a ha gatī yane nū bebe, gītī ūbo walīho ha gatī ya ng'wa baba na so; angū ūlībona gīkī naakwenhelaga feza na zahabu sha kūkwinha. Alilūūlū, īngaga ū mu būlagane ūbo būlīho a ha gatī yako nū Baasha ū ntemi wa Isilaeli; anīngīle ū mu sī yane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Beni-hadadi ūzunya ī ya ng'wa Asa, ūtūma bashilikale bakwe kwīdumīla ī sī ya Isilaeli; wīdima mizengo ya Iyoni, Dani, Abeli-beti-maka, nī Gineleji ī yose; wīsangīja nī Nafutali ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Baasha aho wigwa gīko oya ū kwīzenga ī Lama; wīnga ūshoka Tiliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi Asa ūbalagīla pye a banhū ba Yuda, ndūhū wa kūlekeelwa; būgabūūcha kwīnga ī Lama a mawe nī mitī īyo wazengelaga ū Baasha. Ū ntemi Asa ūshitūmīla ī shikolo shenīsho kwīguzuhya mizengo ya Geba ya mu sī ya Benjamini, nī Misipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo ī yīngī ī yose ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Asa, gītī ya būtindi wakwe pyī ū bose, nī yīyo wabeeja pyī ī yose, nī mizengo īyo akazenga, yose yenīyo yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Yuda. Gwike aho wanahaala no no no, ūsaata a magūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Asa wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa hamò nabo mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi. Ng'witūnja wakwe Yehoshafati wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nadabu ntemi wa Isilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadabu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yeloboamu ūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli mu ng'waka gwa kabīlī go ng'wa Asa ntemi wa Yuda. Ī Isiliaeli wītema ikanza lya myaka ībīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, ūshimīzīla ū mu nzīla ī jose ī ja ng'wa ise, nū mu būhūbi bokwe, ūbo walī wabenheleja a Baisilaeli kūhūba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baasha ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahiya munhū wa numba ya ng'wa Asheli ūng'wijomboka ūntūla balī Gibesoni, nzengo gūmò gwaho gwa Bafilisiti. Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Nadabu walī na bashilikale bakwe baalī bagūpīndije ū nzengo gwenūyo kūgūdumīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Baasha ūmūlaga ū Nadabu mu ng'waka gwa kadatū go būtemi bo ng'wa Asa ū ntemi wa Yuda; wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi wei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wandya dūhū ū kūtema ūbabūlaga pye a banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Yeloboamu. Ū Yeloboamu atanekelile munhū mpanga ose ose; ūbayagaja pye gete, kūlenganīla nū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo walī wagūfunya mu nzīla ya ntūmami wakwe Ahiya muna Shilo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nguno ya būhūbi ūbo walī wawīta ū Yeloboamu ūbenheleja a Baisilaeli kūhūba, na kūlwa nguno akampelanya no ū SEEBA Mulungu wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Nadabu, nī yīyo wīta ī yose yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boolīho būlūgū a ha gatī ya ng'wa Asa nū Baasha ū ntemi wa Isilaeli, ū mu shikū jabo jose aho balī batemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
